    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 21</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XVIIII} Gif preost oðerne mon óflsea, weorpe mon to handa ⁊ eall ðæt he him hames bohte, ⁊ hine biscep onhadige, þonne hine mon of ðam mynstre agife, buton se hlaford þone wer forðingian wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a priest slays another man, he shall be turned in as well as all that he bought for his home [in the church community], and the bishop shall defrock him when he is expelled from the minster, unless the lord is willing to negotiate payment of the wer [of the slain man].</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a priest slays another man, he and all the share of the monastic property which he has bought for himself shall be given up; and the bishop shall unfrock him when he is ejected from the monastery and given up, unless the lord [of the monastery] is willing to answer for the wergeld [of the slain man].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XIX. Gif preost oþerne mon ofslea, weorpe mon to handa ⁊ eal ðæt he mid him hames brohte, ond hine biscop onhadige, ðonne hine mon of þæm mynstre agife, buton se hlaford þone wer forðingian wille.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
